      "stepByStep": "1. In sodium nitroprusside, the nitric oxide ligand is present as nitrosonium ion NO+.\n2. Cyanide CN- is -1 each.\n3. Sum: 2(+1) + x + 5(-1) + 1 = 0 => x = +2.\n4. Thus, iron is in the +2 oxidation state (low spin d6, diamagnetic).",
